<title>POLAND: Animex plans no 1996 payout.</title>
<headline>Animex plans no 1996 payout.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish food producer and trader Animex SA plans no 1996 dividend and has no payout plans for the next two years, the company's president said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>&quot;The management will not propose a dividend for 1996, 1997 and 1998. We are now looking for money so a payout wouldn't be appropriate,&quot; Witold Pereta said.</p>
<p>The company wants to issue 10 million shares for its planned 1997-1998 investments.</p>
<p>Last year Animex paid 0.2 zlotys of dividend per share.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
